      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "La última vez, Māui encontró a sus padres en el mundo de abajo, y su padre cometió un error fatal.",
          "en": "Last time, Māui found his parents in the world below, and his father made a fatal mistake."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ahora Māui estaba de vuelta en casa, siempre buscando un truco nuevo.",
          "en": "Now Māui was back home, always looking for a new trick."
        },
        {
          "es": "Esta historia también viene del libro de George Grey, de los escritos de Te Rangikāheke, de Te Arawa.",
          "en": "This story also comes from George Grey's book, from the writings of Te Rangikāheke, of Te Arawa."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cada día, la gente llevaba comida a una anciana que vivía lejos.",
          "en": "Every day, people carried food to an old woman who lived far away."
        },
        {
          "es": "Era Muri-ranga-whenua, la abuela de Māui.",
          "en": "She was Muri-ranga-whenua, Māui's grandmother."
        }
      ],
