      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Entonces volvió a olfatear, y se detuvo. Ese olor era de su propia familia.",
          "en": "Then she sniffed again, and stopped. That smell belonged to her own family."
        },
        {
          "es": "Su panza se deshinchó. «¿Eres tú, Māui?», preguntó. «Soy yo», dijo él.",
          "en": "Her belly went down. 'Is that you, Māui?' she asked. 'It is me,' he said."
        },
        {
          "es": "«He venido por tu quijada», dijo Māui.",
          "en": "'I have come for your jawbone,' said Māui."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y Muri-ranga-whenua se la dio: su quijada mágica.",
          "en": "And Muri-ranga-whenua gave it to him: her magic jawbone."
        },
        {
          "es": "Con ella, Māui haría cosas asombrosas.",
          "en": "With it, Māui would do amazing things."
        }
