        {
          "es": "«Atrapemos al sol», les dijo Māui a sus hermanos, «y obliguémoslo a ir más despacio».",
          "en": "'Let us catch the sun,' Māui told his brothers, 'and make it go more slowly.'"
        },
        {
          "es": "Sus hermanos tenían miedo. «Nadie puede acercarse al sol. Su calor es terrible.»",
          "en": "His brothers were afraid. 'No one can get near the sun. Its heat is too fierce.'"
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero Māui les recordó todas las cosas que ya había hecho.",
          "en": "But Māui reminded them of all the things he had already done."
        },
        {
          "es": "Al final, aceptaron ayudarlo.",
          "en": "In the end, they agreed to help him."
        }
