      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Así que cortaron harakeke, el lino fuerte que crece en Aotearoa, y empezaron a hacer sogas.",
          "en": "So they cut harakeke, the strong flax that grows in Aotearoa, and began to make ropes."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hilaron y trenzaron, una soga tras otra.",
          "en": "They spun and they plaited, one rope after another."
        },
        {
          "es": "Según Grey, así aprendieron a trenzar sogas de distintas formas: planas, cuadradas y redondas.",
          "en": "Grey says that is how they learned to plait ropes in different shapes: flat, square and round."
        },
        {
          "es": "Con ellas armaron un lazo enorme.",
          "en": "With them, they made a huge noose."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ya estaban listos para ir a cazar al sol.",
          "en": "Now they were ready to go hunting for the sun."
